---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Privacy"><section class="section"><div class="wrap reading"><p class="eyebrow">PRIVACY</p><h1>Business inquiries, handled with purpose.</h1><p>Release 1 collects information you choose to submit through inquiry and contact forms so Kora can understand and respond to a business request. The information is stored in Kora-controlled first-party infrastructure and reviewed by authorized staff.</p><h2>What we do not want</h2><p>Do not submit classified information, CUI, export-controlled information, passwords, access tokens, payment or bank details, SSNs, PHI, patient records, or sensitive network information.</p><h2>Retention and deletion</h2><p>Retention settings are configurable. The current development target is 24 months for inquiries and 30 days for spam, pending final business and privacy approval. Contact <a href="mailto:info@korasb.com">info@korasb.com</a> with privacy questions or a deletion request.</p><h2>Tracking</h2><p>Release 1 does not require advertising, behavioral profiling, session replay, or non-essential analytics cookies. Forms do not persist abandoned free-form drafts in local storage.</p></div></section></SiteLayout>
